WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.031 --> 00:00:04.086
Rain poured down on the slope of the mountain.

2
00:00:04.087 --> 00:00:09.636
Roxy, the Tang Monk, and Wujing expected the Demon of Black Rain to attack again.

3
00:00:09.637 --> 00:00:14.934
The mountain's spirit appeared in front of the rain.

4
00:00:14.935 --> 00:00:22.163
"Hurry!" she said. "I can control much of what happens on my mountain.

5
00:00:22.164 --> 00:00:28.840
But the demon is powerful, so I can't hold him back for long!"

6
00:00:28.841 --> 00:00:36.430
"Thank you!" Roxy shouted.

7
00:00:36.431 --> 00:00:43.531
When she and the others were far from Birdsong Mountain, they stopped to rest.

8
00:00:43.532 --> 00:00:46.523
The Tang Monk thanked Roxy.

9
00:00:46.524 --> 00:00:51.751
"You're not from around here. Did you come from across the ocean?"

10
00:00:51.752 --> 00:00:55.997
"No, I'm from another world," Roxy said.

11
00:00:55.998 --> 00:00:59.158
"Amazing!" the Tang Monk said.

12
00:00:59.159 --> 00:01:02.856
"My companions and I are traveling to the Western Paradise.

13
00:01:02.857 --> 00:01:06.941
I hope to receive the True Scriptures from Buddha."

14
00:01:06.942 --> 00:01:10.426
"The mountain's spirit told me that," Roxy said.

15
00:01:10.427 --> 00:01:15.036
"I wish I could help you, but I must figure out how to get home."

16
00:01:15.037 --> 00:01:25.017
"I understand," the monk said.

17
00:01:25.018 --> 00:01:31.030
"We have two other companions, but I'm not sure where they are."

18
00:01:31.031 --> 00:01:34.745
"Oh!" Roxy suddenly remembered something.

19
00:01:34.746 --> 00:01:38.903
"The mountain's spirit told me you're traveling with Sun Wukong.

20
00:01:38.904 --> 00:01:41.350
He's in my world right now.

21
00:01:41.351 --> 00:01:46.320
I was fighting with him, but then he tricked me into falling through a portal.

22
00:01:46.321 --> 00:01:50.060
That's how I got here." She shook her head.

23
00:01:50.061 --> 00:01:54.828
"He was causing lots of trouble."

24
00:01:54.829 --> 00:02:00.094
"I'm not surprised," the monk said with a sigh.

25
00:02:00.095 --> 00:02:03.628
"Wukong is still learning how to be good."

26
00:02:03.629 --> 00:02:08.819
"I'm not surprised either," Wujing said as he looked around.

27
00:02:08.820 --> 00:02:12.028
"We still don't know where Bajie is."

28
00:02:12.029 --> 00:02:16.780
Roxy gasped. "I met him too!"

29
00:02:16.781 --> 00:02:22.152
"Is he also in your world?" Wujing asked, lifting an eyebrow.

30
00:02:22.153 --> 00:02:27.320
"Yep, he's in jail," Roxy said.

31
00:02:27.321 --> 00:02:34.000
The Tang Monk put his head in his hands. "Why won't they learn to be good?"

32
00:02:34.001 --> 00:02:37.810
"It's really important that I get home," Roxy said.

33
00:02:37.811 --> 00:02:44.954
"I don't know what kind of trouble Wukong is causing now that I'm not there." She sighed.

34
00:02:44.955 --> 00:02:48.101
"When I get back, I don't know what I'll do.

35
00:02:48.102 --> 00:02:53.098
He's as powerful as I am—I can't defeat him."

36
00:02:53.099 --> 00:02:59.756
"Don't worry, I can stop him," the monk said.

37
00:02:59.757 --> 00:03:04.612
"But we don't know how to open the portal, Master," Wujing said.

38
00:03:04.613 --> 00:03:09.630
"Only Wukong and the Demon of Black Rain know how to do that."

39
00:03:09.631 --> 00:03:13.513
"Don't forget Swift Wing," the Tang Monk said.

40
00:03:13.514 --> 00:03:19.303
"She can help us because she's studying with the bodhisattva Guanyin on Mount Potalaka."

41
00:03:19.304 --> 00:03:24.360
"Master," Wujing said. "Mount Potalaka is far away.

42
00:03:24.361 --> 00:03:33.915
And the last time I left you alone, the demon captured you. I can't leave you again."

43
00:03:33.916 --> 00:03:39.104
"I'll go," Roxy said. "I just need directions."

44
00:03:39.105 --> 00:03:47.588
Wujing frowned. "You're not a spirit, so I don't think you can go there."

45
00:03:47.589 --> 00:03:52.496
Roxy shrugged. "I'll try it."

46
00:03:52.497 --> 00:03:58.414
"Mount Potalaka is in the middle of the South Sea," Wujing said.

47
00:03:58.415 --> 00:04:03.811
He told Roxy how to find the mountain.

48
00:04:03.812 --> 00:04:09.232
Roxy took off, soaring over the South Sea.

49
00:04:09.233 --> 00:04:12.832
She looked everywhere, but she didn't see any mountains.

50
00:04:12.833 --> 00:04:19.684
However, she eventually saw another continent below.

51
00:04:19.685 --> 00:04:27.789
"I flew over the entire sea," Roxy said, groaning. "Where's Mount . . . ?"

52
00:04:27.790 --> 00:04:38.648
Bright light filled the sky, and a voice thundered. "Who are you?"

